cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use AFX in your research, please cite it as below.
title: "AFX: Audio Feature Extraction for Machine Learning"
abstract: >-
  AFX extracts time-domain, spectral, cepstral, harmonic and linear-prediction
  audio features from NumPy signals, with per-frame and aggregated outputs and
  a parity test suite against librosa. The same features are exposed as a
  scikit-learn transformer and as differentiable PyTorch functions.
authors:
